Vendored dependency: Heimdall
-----------------------------

The directory native/vendor/Heimdall/ is a copy of Heimdall v2.2.2, taken from
the grimler fork:

    https://git.sr.ht/~grimler/Heimdall

The version string "v2.2.2" is in the vendored tree itself, at
native/vendor/Heimdall/heimdall/source/Interface.cpp:45.

