The C# packet layer is gone
--------------------------

OdinCore used to carry a C# transcription of Heimdall's packet classes and of
BridgeManager's transport: OdinCore/Protocol/Packets/ (OutboundPacket.cs,
InboundPacket.cs, ControlPackets.cs, PitPackets.cs, FilePackets.cs) and
OdinCore/Usb/UsbDeviceHandle.cs. Those files were DELETED when the vendored C++
became the engine, because two implementations of one wire protocol is worse
than one, and because the C++ is the one upstream maintains. Their derivation
entries are therefore gone from the map below rather than left to describe
files that no longer exist. git history holds them.

